{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04000","headline":"上元夜效小庾体同用春字 · 长孙正隐","name":"上元夜效小庾体同用春字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄晚啸游人，车马乱驱尘。\n月光三五夜，灯焰一重春。\n烟云迷北阙，箫管识南邻。\n洛城终不闭，更出小平津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙正隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}